{"seq":3,"slug":"navier-stokes-intuition","title":"NS 方程直觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/foundations/navier-stokes-intuition","wordCount":1478,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ns-方程直觉\">NS 方程直觉</h1><p>Navier-Stokes 方程在论文里长得像天书，但它说的事情简单到你每天都在经历：把一勺糖浆和一杯水分别搅一下，糖浆慢悠悠地停下、水很快静止，这就是黏性项的差异；把可乐摇一摇打开喷出来，是压力项在起作用；河水绕过桥墩形成漩涡，是平流项在搬运动量。这一篇不教你解这个方程，而是把它拆成四个你能在脑子里演的画面，让你看到任何流体引擎代码里的 <code>advect</code>、<code>pressure</code>、<code>viscosity</code>、<code>force</code> 时，知道每一行在还谁的债。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四项各管一件事\">核心概念：四项各管一件事</h2><p>不可压缩 Navier-Stokes 动量方程，写成游戏程序员看得懂的形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ρ</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>ν</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial \\vec{v}}{\\partial t} = -(\\vec{v}\\cdot\\nabla)\\vec{v} \\;-\\; \\frac{1}{\\rho}\\nabla p \\;+\\; \\nu\\nabla^2\\vec{v} \\;+\\; \\vec{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.077em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.391em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><s